{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-019",
    "title": "：引灯人现身"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_100",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "三年前父亲离开北河城时，穿的就是这件。",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "黑铁门开启后，城心没有亮起来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3075,
          "end": 3075
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门内是一座向下延伸的石厅，墙壁上嵌着数百枚灰白石片。石片大小不一，有的刻着名字，有的只剩一道被磨平的凹痕。每隔十步便有一根灯柱，灯柱没有灯火，却在柱身内部流动着青色的光。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3077,
          "end": 3077
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离站在第一根灯柱旁，盯着上面新出现的名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3079,
          "end": 3079
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾长离，封存经手人之后。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3081,
          "end": 3081
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这是记录，不是判决。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3083,
          "end": 3083
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“对被写进去的人来说，有区别吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3085,
          "end": 3085
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记录会改变，判决不会。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3087,
          "end": 3087
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜沿墙查看石片：“你们无相寺保存了多少这样的记录？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3089,
          "end": 3089
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“保存不是拥有。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3091,
          "end": 3091
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“总要有人看过。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3093,
          "end": 3093
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻转动无相铜镜，镜面照出整座石厅。原本空白的石片在镜中浮出密密麻麻的字，字迹如水流动，不断被擦去又重新出现。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3095,
          "end": 3095
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三百年前，北境灵脉同时逆流。”慧闻说，“山河之间出现了会自行扩张的裂口，凡人先失去记忆，修士随后失去名字。太虚秩序被迫启动，用众生记忆填补裂口。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3097,
          "end": 3097
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所以灾难被修补了？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3099,
          "end": 3099
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“表面上。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3101,
          "end": 3101
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“代价呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3103,
          "end": 3103
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他答应了？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3129,
          "end": 3129
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他拒绝了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3131,
          "end": 3131
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“然后呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3133,
          "end": 3133
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻没有回答。无相铜镜中，一段新的影像浮出：一个佩着顾氏铜环的男人站在城心，手里捧着第二盏灯。他将灯交给一名白发老妇，又把一枚铜环埋入土中。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3135,
          "end": 3135
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "男人转身时，脸已经变得模糊。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3137,
          "end": 3137
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离向前一步：“他还活着。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3139,
          "end": 3139
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“影像不能证明活着。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3141,
          "end": 3141
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可他把灯送回了无灯镇。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3143,
          "end": 3143
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“送灯的人，不一定能回到送灯的地方。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3145,
          "end": 3145
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "石厅两侧的灯柱同时亮起。青光照出墙上被削平的名字，其中一枚石片上浮现出“沈”字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3147,
          "end": 3147
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临想起沈砚秋袖口那半页写着“引灯”的纸。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3149,
          "end": 3149
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“玄霄宗也有人参与？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3151,
          "end": 3151
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三方共同封存。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3153,
          "end": 3153
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁是玄霄宗那个人？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3155,
          "end": 3155
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他后来成为外门执事。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3157,
          "end": 3157
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜转头看陆照临：“沈砚秋。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3159,
          "end": 3159
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离冷声道：“她到底删掉了什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3161,
          "end": 3161
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻将铜镜对准陆照临。镜中没有出现他的脸，只出现一片雪地。雪地中央站着年幼的陆照临，身旁是陆沉舟。陆沉舟手里没有灯，只有一块灰白石片。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3163,
          "end": 3163
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这不可能。”陆照临说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3165,
          "end": 3165
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“为什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3167,
          "end": 3167
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我父亲离开时，我已经十几岁。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3169,
          "end": 3169
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记忆可以被提前修改。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3171,
          "end": 3171
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁修改的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3173,
          "end": 3173
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻收回铜镜：“不是谁，是秩序。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3175,
          "end": 3175
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临感到额角发疼。雪地影像里，陆沉舟正把石片按进他的胸口。年幼的自己没有反抗，反而抬头问了一句什么。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3177,
          "end": 3177
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "影像无声，只有唇形清晰可辨：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3179,
          "end": 3179
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我会忘记你吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3181,
          "end": 3181
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临踉跄后退，撞上灯柱。掌心残印骤然发热，一段陌生记忆从脑海深处浮出：北河城老槐树下，陆沉舟教他辨认三种灯火。第一种照路，第二种照人，第三种照回不去的地方。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3183,
          "end": 3183
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他想起了树冠的方向。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3185,
          "end": 3185
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "也想起父亲最后一次离开时，穿的是一件灰色旧斗篷。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3187,
          "end": 3187
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "下一瞬，记忆又像潮水退去，只留下模糊轮廓。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3189,
          "end": 3189
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你看见了。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3191,
          "end": 3191
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我看见的是真的吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3193,
          "end": 3193
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“真实和记得，不是同一件事。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3195,
          "end": 3195
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜走到石厅中央，指向墙上最完整的一枚石片：“这里写着太虚秩序的条件。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3197,
          "end": 3197
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "石片上的字逐渐清晰：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3199,
          "end": 3199
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“择取是什么意思？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-066",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3205,
          "end": 3205
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "一次。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-078",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3229,
          "end": 3229
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“一盏坏掉的灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3309,
          "end": 3309
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“灯里有什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3311,
          "end": 3311
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“没有灯芯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3313,
          "end": 3313
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "这是陆照临与父亲之间最早的记忆。那盏灯被他拆开过无数次，里面确实没有灯芯。可他从未告诉过任何人。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3315,
          "end": 3315
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜皱眉：“打开门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3317,
          "end": 3317
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻摇头：“身份只能证明记忆相同，不能证明人仍然完整。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3319,
          "end": 3319
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "黑铁门上的字迹开始剥落。门后传来拖行声，像有人正把沉重灯架移到门边。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3321,
          "end": 3321
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“照临，”陆沉舟说，“第二盏灯不能醒。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3323,
          "end": 3323
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离看向陆照临手中的灯：“它已经在醒了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3325,
          "end": 3325
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灯罩内的金光从缝隙中溢出，照亮石厅。门内的人影终于出现，身形高瘦，披着旧灰斗篷，手里提着一盏青色长灯。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3327,
          "end": 3327
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临一眼认出那件斗篷。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3329,
          "end": 3329
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "三年前父亲离开北河城时，穿的就是这件。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3331,
          "end": 3331
        }
      }
    ],
